# ============================================
# KEEP THESE FILE TYPES ONLY
# ============================================

# Python files
!*.py

# SystemVerilog files
!*.sv
!*.svh
!*.v
!*.vh

# Image files
!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg

# Markdown files
!*.md
!*.markdown

# Constraints files
!*.xdc
!*.sdc
!*.pdc
!*.ncf
!*.ucf

# ============================================
# IGNORE EVERYTHING ELSE
# ============================================

# Start by ignoring everything
*

